{"t":"CL","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"Colgate-Palmolive Company","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","employees":33600,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.colgatepalmolive.com","summary_en":"Colgate-Palmolive Company, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells consumer products in the United States and internationally. It operates through two segments: Oral, Personal and Home Care; and Pet Nutrition. The Oral, Personal and Home Care segment offers toothpaste, toothbrushes, mouthwash, bar and liquid hand soaps, shower gels, shampoos, conditioners, deodorants and antiperspirants, skin health products, dishwashing detergents, fabric conditioners, household cleaners, and other related items. This segment markets and sells its products under the Colgate, Palmolive, Darlie, elmex, hello, meridol, Sorriso, Tom's of Maine, EltaMD, Filorga, Irish Spring, Lady Speed Stick, PCA SKIN, Protex, Sanex, Softsoap, Speed Stick, Ajax, Axion, Fabuloso, Murphy, Soupline, and Suavitel brands to a range of traditional and eCommerce retailers, wholesalers, and distributors, as well as dentists and skin health professionals. It also offers pharmaceutical products for dentists and other oral health professionals. The Pet Nutrition segment offers pet nutrition products for everyday nutritional needs under the Hill's Science Diet brand; and a range of therapeutic pet products to help nutritionally support dogs and cats in different stages of health under the Hill's Prescription Diet brand; and a fresh pet food sold to pet specialty and other retailers in Australia under Prime100 brand. This segment markets and sells its products through pet supply retailers, veterinarians, and eCommerce retailers. Colgate-Palmolive Company was founded in 1806 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Colgate-Palmolive Company는 자회사와 함께 미국 및 해외에서 소비자 제품을 제조 및 판매합니다. 구강 관리, 개인 관리, 홈 케어라는 두 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 및 애완동물 영양. 구강, 개인 및 홈 케어 부문에서는 치약, 칫솔, 구강 세척제, 바 및 액체 손 비누, 샤워 젤, 샴푸, 컨디셔너, 탈취제 및 발한 억제제, 피부 건강 제품, 식기 세척제, 섬유 컨디셔너, 가정용 세제 및 기타 관련 품목을 제공합니다. 이 부문은 Colgate, Palmolive, Darlie, elmex, hello, meridol, Sorriso, Tom's of Maine, EltaMD, Filorga, Irish Spring, Lady Speed Stick, PCA SKIN, Protex, Sanex, Softsoap, Speed Stick, Ajax, Axion, Fabuloso, Murphy, Soupline 및 Suavitel 브랜드로 제품을 다양한 전통 및 전자 상거래 소매업체, 도매업체 및 도매업체에 판매하고 있습니다. 대리점, 치과의사, 피부건강 전문가 등이 포함됩니다. 또한 치과의사와 기타 구강 건강 전문가를 위한 의약품도 제공합니다. 애완동물 영양 부문은 Hill's Science Diet 브랜드로 일상적인 영양 요구에 맞는 애완동물 영양 제품을 제공합니다. Hill's Prescription Diet 브랜드로 다양한 건강 단계에 있는 개와 고양이를 영양적으로 지원하는 데 도움이 되는 다양한 애완동물 치료 제품; Prime100 브랜드로 호주의 애완동물 전문점 및 기타 소매업체에 판매되는 신선한 애완동물 사료입니다. 이 부문은 애완동물용품 소매업체, 수의사, 전자상거래 소매업체를 통해 제품을 마케팅하고 판매합니다. Colgate-Palmolive Company는 1806년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":97.94,"mcap":77854515200.0,"pe":38.10895,"fpe":23.886698,"peg":1.7662,"ps":3.6577175,"pb":270.5525,"ev_ebitda":16.507,"div":2.2,"beta":0.308,"hi52":101.18,"lo52":75.96},"fin":{"rev":21284999168.0,"rev_g":0.046,"eps_g":0.033,"gross":0.60644,"op":0.20376,"net":0.09645,"roe":2.31736,"fcf":3373499904.0,"cash":1612000000.0,"debt":7715999744.0,"de":1205.625,"eps":2.57,"feps":4.10019},"own":{"short":0.024500001,"inst":0.86789,"insider":0.0015},"analyst":{"n":20,"mean":101.7,"median":102.5,"high":112.0,"low":88.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.09524,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":7,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":7,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":7,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":7,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":95.0,"priorPriceTarget":87.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy"